   - Bethesda Fallout 4            -- proprietary; NOT included or distributed
   - F4SE / Script Extender         -- proprietary; optional, NOT required, and
                                     NOT included or distributed
   - the Creation Kit                -- proprietary; used as a compiler, and NOT
                                     included or redistributed here

 Those components remain under their own terms. Nothing in this licence grants
 you any right over them, and nothing here redistributes them.

 No game asset, Bethesda file, or extender binary is included in this project
 or in its source distribution. If you find one, that is a bug -- please
 report it.

